    {"verdict": "blocked_deps_conflict", "confirmed_by": "execution", "detail": "python:3.9 + transformers>=3.1,<3.4 → tokenizers==0.8.1.rc2 无 cp39 wheel,源码编译(Rust)失败。py3.8 镜像下无此问题,故仅在需要新 torch 时成为障碍。"},
    {"verdict": "blocked_code", "confirmed_by": "execution", "detail": "脚本默认 model_name='bert-base-uncased',transformers 3.3 走已下线的 cdn.huggingface.co 拉权重 → OSError。本次通过把权重手动下到本地目录并作为 argv[1] 传入绕过(未改代码)。"}
  ],
  "blocker_attribution": "pipeline",
  "verdict_reason": "依赖装得上、真实数据在仓库里、数据加载与 BERT+CNN 模型构建都成功,但损失函数硬编码 .cuda(),而本机 Docker 无 GPU 透传能力,主循环第一步即崩在 CUDA 初始化。",
  "repro": {
    "status": "skipped",
    "skip_reason": "smoke test 未通过(blocked_hardware);且 1 epoch ≈ 35,860 步 BERT 训练远超 30 分钟",
    "estimated_minutes": null,
    "command": null,
    "metric": null,
